Accidents often happen at construction sites, some even take the lives of workers. 3D printers not only reduce labour but can also reduce accidents because this machine will handle dangerous tasks instead of workers.
As a result, projects built with 3D printers will be more affordable. Many new companies around the world are now using this 3D technology to build affordable housing projects.
